e3c47d523c363748\"}\nCONTEXT method \"auto\"\nCONTEXT budget_scope \"The research wall clock starts at protocol.research_budget.start_unix under its recorded start_event. Original acquisition uses verified download completion; an explicitly requested rerun on already verified data has its own fixed campaign start. Every later preparation step, calibration, agent call, failure, training/control and scoring job counts.\"\nCONTEXT no_test_feedback true\nCONTEXT knowledge_revision \"knowledge-access-v3\"\nCONTEXT knowledge_review {\"policy\": \"Evaluate relevant external references against local evidence; adoption is optional. Missing source detail and negative transfer remain explicit.\", \"proposal_output\": \"Add top-level knowledge_assessments: [{knowledge_id, decision: used|considered|rejected|unresolved, rationale, transformed_mechanism, variant_names, nearest_work_difference, falsifier}]. Cover retrieved industry cards; identify the concrete changed mechanism for used cards. This is provenance, not causal proof.\", \"reflection\": \"Review the latest knowledge-usage.json alongside outcomes; distinguish declared use, executed changes, mechanism evidence and unresolved attribution.\"}\nCONTEXT latest_knowledge_usage {\"revision\": \"knowledge-access-v3\", \"retrieved_ids\": [\"unirank-method-hyformer\", \"unirank-method-est\", \"paper:onetrans\", \"paper:hyformer\", \"paper:est\", \"paper:unimixer\"], \"assessments\": [{\"knowledge_id\": \"unirank-method-est\", \"decision\": \"considered\", \"rationale\": \"Retrieved card, benchmark section 2.3 and pinned ESTBlocks.forward were inspected. Field-specific processing is relevant context, but no external effectiveness or full-paper mechanism verification transfers to this task. Local endpoint task trade-offs motivate the factorial.\", \"transformed_mechanism\": \"None adopted: only item/action source coordinates are selected within the inherited terminal residual; no new cross-attention or heterogeneous FFN.\", \"variant_names\": [\"item_mean_action_din\", \"item_din_action_mean\"], \"nearest_work_difference\": \"Changes pooling source at constant architecture/parameters, while the benchmark EST block interleaves cross-attention and sequence/non-sequence FFN updates. Original-paper novelty remains unverified.\", \"falsifier\": \"If both mixed candidates fail against compact_mean, field-specific source selection has no demonstrated added predictive utility in this implementation.\", \"source_refs\": [\"unirank-benchmark-v2\", \"unirank-code:EST\", \"paper:est\"], \"executed_refs\": [{\"trial_id\": \"g1-r0010-item_mean_action_din\", \"source_sha256\": \"97c9562007e3f96ae4c8bfcfeb3e71d7cecbf4a8c130b235530e7d526c51b492\", \"status\": \"success\"}, {\"trial_id\": \"g1-r0010-item_din_action_mean\", \"source_sha256\": \"1ea571cc19b75f5f7c02c9060c5f208bb041518fc8d91d0d2b908a0962214f22\", \"status\": \"success\"}], \"evidence_class\": \"agent-declared usage; not mechanism confirmation\"}, {\"knowledge_id\": \"unirank-method-hyformer\", \"decision\": \"considered\", \"rationale\": \"Retrieved card, benchmark section 2.3 and pinned HyFormerBlock.forward were inspected. Detailed original primary text was unavailable; no original-method priority or reproduction claim. Previous uniform/adaptive controls motivate keeping query decoding absent.\", \"transformed_mechanism\": \"None adopted: retain the compact fixed-summary residual and independently replace its item/action summary sources.\", \"variant_names\": [\"item_mean_action_din\", \"item_din_action_mean\"], \"nearest_work_difference\": \"No new per-layer sequence encoder, global query decoder or query booster. All g0 joint tokens and interaction remain inherited.\", \"falsifier\": \"If improvements are matched by the existing DIN-summary control or vanish with paired seeds, no complementary fixed-summary utility is established; this cannot establish adaptive-query utility.\", \"source_refs\": [\"unirank-benchmark-v2\", \"unirank-code:HyFor